    <!-- Chosen Palette: Professional Deep Red (Tailwind red-800), Black (gray-900), Gray (gray-50/600), and White, as derived from the original presentation's professional and investor-focused theme. -->
    <!-- Application Structure Plan: The SPA is designed as an interactive investor dashboard, not a linear slide-by-slide replica. The structure includes: 1) A Hero section with the main S$100k investment 'ask' and value prop. 2) A 'Core Value' dashboard with key metrics (reach, etc.) and a conceptual Doughnut chart (Chart.js) visualizing the 5-pillar ecosystem. 3) An interactive 'Marketing Pillars' section using JS-powered tabs for drill-down into each of the 5 components (Movie, Exhibitions, etc.). 4) A 'Summary' table and 'Contact' CTA. This structure was chosen to immediately highlight the ROI for an investor (the dashboard) and then allow non-linear, self-directed exploration of the proposal details (the tabs), which is more engaging and user-friendly than a static deck. -->
    <!-- Visualization & Content Choices:
        - Report Info: S$100k Investment, 360° Ecosystem. -> Goal: Hook/Inform. -> Viz/Method: Hero section with large typography (HTML/Tailwind). -> Interaction: None. -> Justification: Immediately frames the proposal for an investor.
        - Report Info: 5 Pillars (Movie, Exhibitions, Roadshows, Seminars, Video). -> Goal: Organize/Summarize. -> Viz/Method: Doughnut Chart (Chart.js) showing 5 conceptual segments. -> Interaction: Hover tooltips. -> Justification: Visually represents the "360°" multi-part concept.
        - Report Info: Key Metrics (100k+ visitors, 50-100 SMEs, 12 months). -> Goal: Inform. -> Viz/Method: Key Metric Cards (HTML/Tailwind). -> Interaction: None. -> Justification: Highlights key ROI numbers quickly.
        - Report Info: Details of 5 Pillars (Slides 4-7). -> Goal: Organize/Drill-down. -> Viz/Method: JS-powered Tabbed Interface. -> Interaction: Click to toggle content visibility. -> Justification: Replaces 5 static slides with one clean, interactive module.
        - Report Info: Summary Table (Slide 8). -> Goal: Compare. -> Viz/Method: Styled HTML Table. -> Interaction: None. -> Justification: Clear, direct presentation of summary logic.
        - CONFIRMING: No SVG used (Unicode icons only). No Mermaid JS used. All charts via Chart.js Canvas.
    -->
    <!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->

